Changelog:
----------

2016-09-01 v1.0.2

    - Made XHTML 1.0 Transitional compliant.
    - Changed htmlspecialchars option from ENT_COMPAT to ENT_QUOTES.

2008-01-02 v1.0.1

    - The defaults.php file should use $GLOBALS['PHORUM'] instead of
      $PHORUM, otherwise the defaults won't work. Thanks to Thomas
      for the heads up.

    - Added new German language files. Thanks to Oliver Riesen!

2007-10-30 v1.0.0

    - Initial release
